    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A digital clock displays time in the format <var>HH</var><const>:</const><var>MM</var>.<br>Some digits remain valid when mirrored, while others become invalid.<br>Find the largest valid time less than or equal to the given <var>time</var> such that its mirrored time is valid.<br>Valid digit mappings are:<br><const>0</const> &rarr; <const>0</const><br><const>1</const> &rarr; <const>1</const><br><const>2</const> &rarr; <const>5</const><br><const>5</const> &rarr; <const>2</const><br><const>8</const> &rarr; <const>8</const><br>All other digits are invalid.<br>To compute the mirrored time:<br><br>1. Reverse the order of the digits.<br>2. Replace each digit using the mapping above.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> A time <var>time</var> in 24-hour format <var>HH</var><const>:</const><var>MM</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The largest valid time as described in the statement, in the same 24-hour format as the input.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><const>00</const> &le; <var>HH</var> &le; <const>23</const><br><const>00</const> &le; <var>MM</var> &le; <const>59</const></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">00:54</pre>\n         <